  "code": "class Solution:\n    def reverseList(self, head):\n        # 先说明变量含义，再完成你的实现\n        prev = None\n\n        cur = head\n\n        while cur !=None:\n            temp = cur.next\n            cur.next = prev\n            prev = cur\n            cur = temp\n\n        return prev\n",
